Stage 5: Implement the admin dashboard, local persistence, CSV import/export, and optional database integration.

Stage 6: Build service pages, policy pages, SEO metadata, accessibility improvements, and responsive polish.

Stage 7: Run the application, inspect it in the browser, run available tests, check console errors, fix broken imports, fix TypeScript errors, and resolve build failures.

